    Decomposes an expression to its numerator part and its
    denominator part.

    Examples
    ========

    >>> from sympy.abc import x, y, z
    >>> (x*y/z).as_numer_denom()
    (x*y, z)
    >>> (x*(y + 1)/y**7).as_numer_denom()
    (x*(y + 1), y**7)

